sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant M as Model
  participant H as Host and MCP client
  participant S as MCP server
  participant D as Disposable data store
  H->>S: tools/list for the caller's approved scopes
  S-->>H: Only the tools this principal may see
  M->>H: Propose tools/call with arguments
  H->>S: tools/call with name, arguments and credentials
  Note over S: Authorize the principal and the scope
  Note over S: Validate arguments against the schema
  S->>D: Scoped, parameter-bound, read-only query
  D-->>S: Synthetic rows
  S-->>H: Result, to be treated as untrusted data
  Note over S: Write a redacted audit event
  H-->>M: Tool result for the next step
